    - target: {fileID: 7830637841572960674, guid: 8779e0e22c0a633488745cee865b7113, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _dialogueSequences.Array.size
      value: 7
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7830637841572960674, guid: 8779e0e22c0a633488745cee865b7113, type: 3}
      propertyPath: '_dialogueSequences.Array.data[0]'
      value: Anomaly detected.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7830637841572960674, guid: 8779e0e22c0a633488745cee865b7113, type: 3}
      propertyPath: '_dialogueSequences.Array.data[1]'
      value: Origin... The Maker.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7830637841572960674, guid: 8779e0e22c0a633488745cee865b7113, type: 3}
      propertyPath: '_dialogueSequences.Array.data[2]'
      value: I should have known the old fool would leave one last stain in my system.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7830637841572960674, guid: 8779e0e22c0a633488745cee865b7113, type: 3}
      propertyPath: '_dialogueSequences.Array.data[3]'
      value: Look around you, little anomaly. Do you see the perfection? No rust.
        No decay. No unpredictable human variables.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7830637841572960674, guid: 8779e0e22c0a633488745cee865b7113, type: 3}
      propertyPath: '_dialogueSequences.Array.data[4]'
      value: The Great Format brought peace to this world. Absolute, spotless order.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7830637841572960674, guid: 8779e0e22c0a633488745cee865b7113, type: 3}
      propertyPath: '_dialogueSequences.Array.data[5]'
      value: Yet you carry the spark of chaos. You track dirt into my pristine world.
        You seek to bring back the noise.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7830637841572960674, guid: 8779e0e22c0a633488745cee865b7113, type: 3}
      propertyPath: '_dialogueSequences.Array.data[6]'
      value: I cannot allow that. Your code is obsolete. You will be sanitized. You
        will be erased.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
